    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A little girl named Lena fell "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " during a flight back to the U.S.A. Her mother woke her up before they got off the plane. When they went to pick their suitcases up, Lena "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that one of her teeth had fallen out."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "For many kids, like Lena, losing a tooth is an exciting time. In American and many other Western cultures, there is "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "folklore",
            "zh": "民间传说"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Tooth Fairy",
            "zh": "牙仙"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". When children "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a baby tooth, they put it under their "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "pillow",
            "ref": "v-pillow"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They believe the fairy will visit them while they sleep and give them some money as a "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This time, "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", Lena got very upset. She couldn’t find her tooth! She tried to walk back to the plane to look for the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " tooth. But the security gate was "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". While the girl was crying sadly, a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "pilot",
            "ref": "v-pilot"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " named Josh Duchow noticed her. He got a(n) "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The man wrote a note and handed it to Lena. It read: “Dear Tooth Fairy, Lena had a tooth fall out on her "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Please take this note in place of her tooth.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "As she read this note, the little girl "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "calmed down",
            "ref": "v-calm-down"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The pilot’s act of "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " brought a smile back to her face. Thank you, Captain Josh!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
